# directive-basic

## Input

```
#include path/to/file
#schema https://example.com/schema.json
key value

```

## CST

```
SOURCE_FILE@0..72
  DIRECTIVE@0..22
    SHARP@0..1 "#"
    WORD@1..8 "include"
    SPACE@8..9 " "
    LINE_STRING@9..21
      STRING@9..21 "path/to/file"
    NEWLINE@21..22 "\n"
  DIRECTIVE@22..62
    SHARP@22..23 "#"
    WORD@23..29 "schema"
    SPACE@29..30 " "
    LINE_STRING@30..61
      STRING@30..61 "https://example.com/s ..."
    NEWLINE@61..62 "\n"
  ENTRY@62..72
    WORD_KEY@62..65
      WORD@62..65 "key"
    SPACE@65..66 " "
    LINE_STRING@66..71
      STRING@66..71 "value"
    NEWLINE@71..72 "\n"
```

## AST

```
SourceFile {
    items: [
        Directive {
            sharp: SHARP@0..1 "#",
            name: WORD@1..8 "include",
            args: LineString {
                string: STRING@9..21 "path/to/file",
            },
        },
        Directive {
            sharp: SHARP@22..23 "#",
            name: WORD@23..29 "schema",
            args: LineString {
                string: STRING@30..61 "https://example.com/s ...",
            },
        },
        Entry {
            key: WordKey {
                word: WORD@62..65 "key",
            },
            value: LineString {
                string: STRING@66..71 "value",
            },
        },
    ],
}
```

